 "name": "Laurus Labs Ltd",
 "about": "Founded in 2005, Laurus Labs is a research-driven pharmaceutical and biotechnology company having a global leadership position in select Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients (APIs) including anti-retroviral, oncology drugs (including High Potent APIs), Cardiovascular, and Gastro therapeutics. They also offer integrated CMO and CDMO services to Global Innovators from Clinical phase drug development to commercial manufacturing. Laurus employs 6,500+ people, including around 1,050+ scientists, at more than 11 facilities approved by global agencies USFDA, WHO-Geneva, Japan-PDMA, UK-MHRA, EMA, TGA etc. [1]",
 "key_points": "Business Segments: a) Generic API: [1] The company has one of the largest HiPotent API manufacturing capacities in India and is the world's leading third-party supplier of antiretroviral APIs . Its portfolio includes antiretrovirals, oncology, steroids, hormones, and cardiovascular APIs, serving global generic pharmaceutical companies. b) Generics FDF: [2] The company offers oral solid formulations, across therapeutic areas like ARVs, Anti-diabetic, Cardiovascular, and Proton-Pump Inhibitors (PPIs). c) CDMO Synthesis: [1] The custom synthesis division, Laurus Synthesis , offers drug development and manufacturing services like contract manufacturing, clinical supplies, and analytical research to global pharma, crop science, animal health, specialty ingredients, and biotech firms. Key markets include the US, EU, and Japan. The company has a CDMO pipeline of 70+ active projects, including break through designated molecules, 10 of which are commercial (APIs and intermediates). It is working on 20+ active projects in Animal Health and Crop Protection chemicals, with ongoing commercial validation supplies. Both projects are expected to reach peak potential by FY27-28. [3] d) Biotechnology: The company\u2019s subsidiary Laurus Bio** offers end-to-end services from clone and strain engineering to large-scale production, supporting clients in the microbial precision fermentation. Its offerings include nutraceuticals, dietary supplements, cosmeceuticals, and alternative food proteins, cater",
